 They were delicious, but maybe a little expensive for what you get. Otherwise, great experience!"},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","review_id":"nXo3KlEDBx7xhS8FfwcNuw","date":"2019-03-10T21:49:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9352407455444336,"text_excerpt":"The balcony seating is what I came for. The crawfish mac and cheese was the BEST!! Gumbo was good and the jambalaya was good too, not the best because I'm a big foodie. So I'm sorry, not sorry! This spot is good to go to as you can watch the bourbon street fun while you grub up! It's pretty central and right across some of the big clubs off the strip!"},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","review_id":"NIo3EUek27EGE56SR6JXTg","date":"2021-04-23T20:13:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9324992299079895,"text_excerpt":"Great spot in heart of the French district on Bourbon St. We sat on the balcony to enjoy our meal. We had delicious appetizers and drinks. I definitely recommend trying the fried alligator. Reynard, our server, was attentive and did an outstanding job to make sure we enjoyed our visit. Nice dive bar/restaurant spot!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","photo_id":"WNNj8bxLMk7aKIFVTqs58Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WNNj8bxLMk7aKIFVTqs58Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8885562419891357},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","photo_id":"0T4TqKwEz6-IS5fU734OvA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0T4TqKwEz6-IS5fU734OvA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8492457866668701},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","photo_id":"D2dET3hTsu82kwtZLzSWcg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/D2dET3hTsu82kwtZLzSWcg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8470406532287598},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","photo_id":"QhsHO4a3mYyQBK33YtLWmg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QhsHO4a3mYyQBK33YtLWmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8217445611953735},{"business_id":"-s6EMVPCBrsocFDuiMMqxQ","photo_id":"Z7AnpzfLYbpJE_CEqcog9g","label":"inside","image_u